        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.85,
          "end": 141.96,
          "en": "from @Angular/common/http.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.96,
          "end": 144.903,
          "en": "So make sure to add this import at the top of your path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.43,
          "end": 149.73,
          "en": "Now with it imported, we can use it to send HTTP requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 149.73,
          "end": 151.44,
          "en": "And how does this work now?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.44,
          "end": 153.27,
          "en": "Now let's say here in on create post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.27,
          "end": 157.173,
          "en": "once we got that post data, we want to send it to Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 158.01,
          "end": 161.25,
          "en": "For this, we can use that injected HTTP service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 161.25,
          "end": 163.82999999999998,
          "en": "And there you have a couple of methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.82999999999998,
          "end": 168.06,
          "en": "These methods are mostly named like the HTTP warps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 168.06,
          "end": 170.7,
          "en": "So you have get, you have delete, you have post",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 170.7,
          "end": 174.54,
          "en": "and that will allow you to send different kinds of requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.54,
          "end": 176.64,
          "en": "Now here, since I wanna store data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 179.31,
          "en": "I'll start with a post request.",
