        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 185.61,
          "end": 188.94,
          "en": "send this request to, and that is the URL you can find",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.94,
          "end": 190.77,
          "en": "in your Firebase realtime database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 190.77,
          "end": 194.58,
          "en": "This URL or at least this URL is a part of the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 194.58,
          "end": 196.26,
          "en": "we'll send the request to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 196.26,
          "end": 200.01,
          "en": "So paste that in here, but this is not the entire URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 200.01,
          "end": 200.989,
          "en": "Now, on a customer or on different REST APIs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.989,
          "end": 204.6,
          "en": "you're communicating with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 204.6,
          "end": 206.88,
          "en": "you would have clearly defined endpoints",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.88,
          "end": 208.017,
          "en": "like slash posts, ad, or something like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 208.017,
          "end": 211.737,
          "en": "to which you have to send your requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.737,
          "end": 214.47,
          "en": "and the official docs of the API you're working with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.47,
          "end": 218.19,
          "en": "would tell you which API endpoint to send the request to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 218.19,
          "end": 220.41,
          "en": "For Firebase base, it's a bit different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 220.41,
          "end": 223.528,
          "en": "You have this starting point URL here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 223.528,
          "end": 227.49,
          "en": "and then you can add your own segments after that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 227.49,
          "end": 230.91,
          "en": "And this will get replicated as folders in this database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.91,
          "end": 232.65,
          "en": "So to say, and this looks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 232.65,
          "end": 235.44,
          "en": "like you're directly talking to the database, but keep",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 235.44,
          "end": 239.16,
          "en": "in mind that Firebase only abstracts this away from you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 239.16,
          "end": 240.66,
          "en": "You are still communicating",
